<h2 id="bottom-line">The bottom line</h2>
<p>So, how much does it cost to self-publish a book? <strong>Amazon charges nothing. A book that looks and reads professionally usually costs $500 to $3,000</strong>, and you can go far lower or far higher depending on how much you do yourself.</p>
<p>Spend first on the things readers judge before they buy (the cover and a clean, edited text), keep your rights and royalties, and treat marketing as a test you scale only once the listing converts. Do that, and your budget becomes an investment you can actually earn back.</p>
